  "details": "In previous versions of SDK-Worlds and SDK3 the VRC.Udon.Editor.ProgramSources.UdonGraphProgram.UI.GraphView (Editor window for editing Udon Graphs) had a public method for opening an UdonGraphProgramAsset in the GraphView:\n```\npublic void InitializeGraph(UdonGraphProgramAsset graph, UdonBehaviour udonBehaviour = null)\n```\nSDK-Worlds 3.1.9 and SDK3 2020.3.2 don't have this method anymore, but they do have a new method which was added in the update and essentially serves the same purpose:\n```\npublic void LoadGraphFromAsset(UdonGraphProgramAsset graph, UdonBehaviour udonBehaviour = null)\n```\nThe removal of the existing public method took place without a notice and editor extension developers who were relying on this method's existence didn't have a sufficient time window to roll out updates for this.\nIn case of method renamings / replacements I would expect to see the deprecated method to be marked with [Obsolete] attribute and for the change to be documented in order to help avoid compiler errors on the world creators' end when updating the SDK.\nExample issue caused by the change: https://github.com/Varneon/UdonExplorer/issues/3\nExample patch for fixing the issue above: https://github.com/Varneon/UdonExplorer/releases/tag/0.3.3",
